        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Jenrick, Fiona Jones\n- Places: Newark, Newark constituency\n- Events: Newark by-election, 2014\n- Roles: Member of Parliament\n\nFacts:\n- In 1997, Fiona Jones was elected Member of Parliament for Newark.\n- In April 2014, the Member of Parliament for the Newark constituency was suspended.\n- The suspension led to the Newark by-election in 2014.\n- Robert Jenrick won the Newark by-election in 2014 for Newark.",
